---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Antalya Events & Festivals | Verified Dates"
pageDescription: "Find Antalya concerts, festivals and sports events with source links, verified dates, archived editions and working travel-date filters."
pageUrl: "/events/"
ogImage: "/images/photos/things-to-do-cover.jpg"
permalink: "/events/index.html"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="listing-hero"><div class="container">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Events</div>
  <span class="eyebrow">Plan around something memorable</span>
  <h1>What's on in Antalya</h1>
  <p class="lead">Concert nights, cultural festivals and days worth travelling for. Confirmed dates, clear sources, no guesswork.</p>
  <p>Sources reviewed 9 November 2026. This is an editorial selection, not a live ticket feed. Check the organizer before booking travel. All dates use Antalya local time.</p>
</div></section>
<section><div class="container" data-event-directory>
    <form data-event-filters class="filter-panel" hidden aria-label="Filter events">
      <div class="filter-grid">
        <label>Search events<input type="search" name="query" placeholder="Name, venue or category"></label>
        <label>Category<select name="category"><option value="">All categories</option>{% for cat in collections.eventCategories %}<option value="{{ cat.name }}">{{ cat.name }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></label>
        <label>Show<select name="period"><option value="active">On now &amp; upcoming</option><option value="current">On now</option><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="awaiting">Awaiting verified dates</option><option value="archive">Past editions</option><option value="all">All listings</option></select></label>
        <label>From<input type="date" name="from"></label>
        <label>Until<input type="date" name="to"></label>
      </div>
      <button type="reset" class="btn btn-outline">Reset filters</button>
    </form>
    <noscript><p>All listings are shown below. Status labels reflect the last site build; compare the dates with your travel dates and check the linked source.</p></noscript>
    <p data-event-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div data-event-empty hidden class="empty-state"><h2>No confirmed events match these filters</h2><p>Try another date or category, or choose “Awaiting verified dates” or “Past editions”. We do not invent dates to fill the calendar.</p><a href="https://www.antalya.bel.tr/tr/etkinlikler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check the municipal events calendar ↗</a></div>    {% for e in collections.events %}
    {% set status = e.data | eventStatus %}
    <article class="listing-row" data-event data-title="{{ e.data.title }}" data-venue="{{ e.data.venue }}" data-category="{{ e.data.category }}" data-start="{{ e.data.start_date | eventDate }}" data-end="{{ e.data.end_date | eventDate }}" data-verified="{{ e.data.date_verified }}" data-status="{{ status }}">
      <div class="listing-row-media"><img src="{{ e.data.cover }}" alt="Antalya destination scenery" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="listing-row-body">
        <div class="listing-row-top"><div>
          <span class="badge">{{ e.data.category }}</span> <span class="badge" data-event-status>{{ status | eventStatusLabel }}</span>
          <h3 class="listing-row-title"><a href="/events/{{ e.data.title | slugify }}/">{{ e.data.title }}</a></h3>
        </div></div>
        <p class="listing-row-excerpt">{{ e.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="listing-row-meta"><span>{{ e.data | eventDateLabel }}</span><span>{{ e.data.venue }}</span></div>
        <p><small>Source review: {{ e.data.last_checked | eventDate }} · <a href="{{ e.data.source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ e.data.source_name }}</a></small></p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
</div></section>
<section class="tint"><div class="container"><h2>Explore the official calendars</h2><p>For newly announced performances and changes, go straight to the source.</p><div class="quick-links">
<a href="https://www.antalya.bel.tr/tr/etkinlikler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Municipal events ↗</a>
<a href="https://www.operabale.gov.tr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">State Opera &amp; Ballet ↗</a>
<a href="https://antalyaff.com/tr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Golden Orange Film Festival ↗</a>
</div><h3>Browse by category</h3><div class="quick-links">{% for cat in collections.eventCategories %}<a href="/events/category/{{ cat.name | slugify }}/">{{ cat.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<script src="/js/events.js" defer></script>
